<PageTitle>Sample — framework consumer</PageTitle>

<h1>Sample app</h1>

<p>
    This is the reference consumer of the AWS Web App framework — a standalone solution that
    uses <code>Tjb.Web.Framework</code> / <code>Tjb.Web.Hosting</code> purely via NuGet (no
    project references into the framework's own repo projects).
</p>

<p>
    Sign in, then visit the <a href="guestbook">Guestbook</a> to post an entry — that exercises
    the full reuse seam: framework Identity into the sample's own data.
</p>
